<title>USA: Northern States Power unit issues TOPRS.</title>
<headline>Northern States Power unit issues TOPRS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of trust originated trust preferred stock (TOPRS) from Northern States Power's NSP Finance I was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NSP FINANCE I</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 SHARES 8 MLN	 MATURITY 1/31/2037</p>
<p>TYPE TOPRS	   ISS PRICE $25	FIRST PAY DATE 3/31/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    DIVIDEND 7.875 PCT PAY FREQ QUARTER</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS			     CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
